{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0925905bbce1871f57f4fb20e77d7740c07f50938da1f84c34c80183d863eabd", "ja": "（地方公演のため、アイドル達と前日入り。みんな\n合宿みたいに騒いでいたけど、やっと落ち着いたかな）", "zh": "（为了地方公演，我和偶像们提前一天抵达当地。\n大家像集训一样吵吵闹闹，现在应该静下来了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "7fce89cc3573dc2dcc1fed2a328308c9a6bcc02ccd2ea18e09841d8adbf02107", "ja": "くんくん……。\nはあ……いい香り……♪", "zh": "（闻闻）……\n呼……味道好香……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ea0cc399555f5aac80d90a347411361551cea4ec3dd4525529397c1f17a35a87", "ja": "お疲れさま……あれ、可憐ひとりか？\nそれに、なんだかいい香りがするな。", "zh": "辛苦了……咦，只有可怜一个人吗？\n而且好像有一股很香的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "f8cd1f0342451ed84808b9fcae0481ff5c56fe38f1277c37896f81b40336a33c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……\nは、はい。みんな、お風呂に行ってて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n是、是的，我刚才和大家一起去洗澡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "3b6ee9825a10cf357022e991961a45cc22b288a34d784a137dcf4cc86a6a7d7b", "ja": "私は、ちょっと喉が渇いたので……\nお風呂の前に、ハーブティーを淹れてたんです……。", "zh": "因为觉得有点口渴……\n我洗澡前泡了花草茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "c5b60f87dfcab49d14941f700f0859836d50ed030d9ed5b52b15561278ecc861", "ja": "あの……よ、よかったら、\n{$P$}さんもどうですか……？", "zh": "那个……不、不嫌弃的话，\n{$P$}先生要不要喝呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "68e687cbaf50a824ec114c8e283423a1fa00686f4dd012455b01584a773580a6", "ja": "ありがとう、じゃあ一杯いただくよ。\nへえ……普通の緑茶に見えるけど、香りがするんだな。", "zh": "谢谢，那我就喝一杯吧。\n哦……看起来像普通的绿茶，可是有种香气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "2b1b253c19c8958e70c513d44908f1a5a8a827c64e8ae25a903b84a75742de3d", "ja": "は、はい！　緑茶と、ラベンダーのブレンドです……\nすごく、リラックスできるんですよ……♪", "zh": "是、是的！这是绿茶加上薰衣草……\n喝了可以非常放松喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "cacc2eb1cabd502da6540124a4af815526bc2a2199b4e51c42c580991df46918", "ja": "ラベンダーの香りで、よく眠れますし……\nお、お月見には、ぴったりかもって……。", "zh": "而且薰衣草的香味可以帮助睡眠……\n我、我想应该很适合赏月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ee16206cdc501fdf2516a1e928a6620da00b8f3dd14b9f89275b64d1e109f0a5", "ja": "そうか。\nこれが、ラベンダーの香りだったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n原来这就是薰衣草的香味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "8b5b2af4bb426566c3950791088fc0c12c8da07a68f91a0ba90ead712e8a0ea8", "ja": "はい……。\nげ、劇場でも、時々アロマを焚いていますけど……。", "zh": "是的……\n我、我在剧场有时也会点精油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "4f8da73104a87afadb3f2c721da3ab0f66266e331a7a6c9b016826c5016d2b75", "ja": "でも、アロマポットで焚いているものと、今日の\nハーブティーは……香りが、けっこう違うんです……。", "zh": "不过，用精油烛台点的，跟今天泡的花草茶相比……\n香气大不相同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "1bebf204c004b783a1ec5c627b31996139364b74896fe6e08debada73ed20900", "ja": "劇場で焚いていたラベンダーは、ブルガリア産で……\nす、透き通った香りが、特徴なんです……♪", "zh": "在剧场点的薰衣草是保加利亚产的……\n它、它的特征是香气很清澈……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bb25f5e6c3c20940118d7fba75d14f0f8ffafab19365dfcbd8f7b9251dcc25a3", "ja": "へえ……そうなのか。\n同じハーブでも、違いがあるんだな。", "zh": "哦……这样啊，\n尽管一样是香草植物，还是各有不同吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "b39c2ae5f6224dced91773a0f69ac6e1fca99d00a42c2a988326c0f2a21ca3ae", "ja": "は、はい……ハーブは品種によって、\n違いがわかりやすいので……。", "zh": "是、是的……不同品种的香草植物，\n差异也会挺明显的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "48f4e0267ec9f44b318b04a0c363e1f14460a3d975fb58607503e47494af16c5", "ja": "も、もしよかったら……\n今度、香りを……く、比べてみませんか……？", "zh": "若、若你不嫌弃……\n下次要不要……比、比较看看香味呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "5d4bc65733d3958be2fec552d9ac0a3755730af61b969d9738e3805154b27b94", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、合ったハーブ……\n見つけてもらえるかなって……。", "zh": "也许可以找到……\n适合{$P$}先生的香草植物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "94d784d8d431ac615df4ab206d00d9afc79ae05cbc9d6a2e1b3c8be7accd7a64", "ja": "ハーブで癒やされるか……。\nそれじゃあ、今度試してみようかな。", "zh": "靠香草植物疗愈心灵吗……\n那我下次尝试看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "64b1750c09a6325179ffb4f015aa36e8ac025d7477ffd290f9c3be4aa8ea64c6", "ja": "は、はいっ……やりましょう！\n私、い、いろんなハーブを用意しますね……！", "zh": "好、好的……来试试看吧！\n我会准备很、很多种香草植物……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0143_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "fbc10969b3353cc0ed643064b9565049815636766345df9040526b6c4551cc40", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、気に入ってもらえると\nいいな……い、今から楽しみです……えへ♪", "zh": "希望{$P$}先生会喜欢……\n我、我现在就好期待喔……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
